Package: formex
Title: Format Expressions and Data-Type Detection for Research Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", email = "jlecy@urban.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Olivia", "Beck", email = "obeck@urban.org", role = "aut"))
Description: A vocabulary and detection engine for the data types found in
    research datasets. Provides a library of column detectors (identifiers,
    geographies, temporal formats, currencies, codes, hashes, and more), a
    dispatchable data-type registry, the formex format-expression syntax, and
    the type/class/subclass ontology that names them. 'guess_data_type()' is
    the single entry point that other packages build on.
